{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060228/block/singleImage/3248061/wm/01M5SRW9BBPJMK8CPQKAQGXVEX.JPG?updatedAt=1792988766\"/><figcaption>利奧坊．壹隅一房成交呎租逾71元。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產奧運站奧海城分行首席分區營業經理黃家全表示，中原最新促成利奧坊．壹隅 1 座中層 F 室租賃成交，單位實用面積約 265 方呎，屬一房間隔，坐向西方，外望開揚市景及海景，以 1.9 萬元租出，呎租約 71.7 元。 黃家全指，上址業主於 2022 年以 676 萬元購入單位，現享近 3.4 厘租金回報，回報理想。 資料顯示，利奧坊．壹隅位於大角咀深旺道 5 號， 2024 年入伙，共有 2 座，提供 614 個單位。 即睇大角咀利奧坊．壹隅租盤 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:41:28.690621+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":263,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:18:19.888862+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T09:38:14.833638+00:00","content_hash":"40d8fc7f383b1f242f30b301b37005f5a9c24f615a34818cccdbfd75be22a702","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:41:28.690621+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}